; --- 37E: the bed -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; A free `ServiceKind.Inn` gated on owning the holding. ⚠️ THE GATE IS THE WHOLE POINT — without it
; any passer-by sleeps in the player's bed, and `ServiceComponent` had no ownership check before 37E
; while `PropertyStorageComponent` and `TrophyStandComponent` both did. It reads `HousingService.Owns`
; through the same call they use.
;
; ⚠️ It is deliberately free, and DESIGN §6 carries the argument: the inn is 10 gold a night forever,
; this house was 600 gold once, and the purchase IS the sink. The inn keeps its job for every player
; who has not bought and in every settlement that is not this one.

[node name="AshfallBed" type="Node3D" parent="."]
