; --- 37E second pass: planting ---------------------------------------------------------------------
; ⚠️ A 52 m plot with three trees and four grass tufts renders as a green plane. Ground cover goes in
; PATCHES (the nature kit's own rule) rather than spread evenly, so the eye reads clumps and not a
; lawn. None of it takes a collider: it is ground cover, and fencing a garden off from its owner is
; the defect this avoids.

